## Current Structure

- `index.html`: homepage, resource accordion, FAQ/about content, static fallback footer.
- `intro/notes/`: beginner cybersecurity, glossary, landscape, operating systems, networking, access control, shell scripting, practice, and GRC foundation.
- `intermediate/notes/`: Linux practical course, VLAN, networking interview prep, and GRC intermediate.
- `intermediate/tools/`: grep, sed, awk, Vim, Nmap, and CLI trinity wrap-up.
- `pro/`: security project roadmap, Wireshark PCAP analysis, and GRC professional guide.
- `css/style.css`: main shared site styling, including homepage, shared footer, learning-page helpers, and GRC presentation.
- `css/global-ui.css`: floating quick-action UI.
- `js/main.js`: shared navbar, shared footer, floating actions, and site behavior.
- `sitemap.xml`: search engine sitemap with 30 URLs.
- `sitemap.xsl`: styled browser view for the XML sitemap.

